                      "value": "Input - {{$context.$nodes.GET_FILTER_FROM_REQUEST_1.$output.result}}\n\nExtract period values from `accountingPeriod.$memberName`.\n\nReturn only this object:\n\n{\n  currPeriod: \"\",\n  prevPeriod: \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- If `accountingPeriod.$memberName` has multiple values, use the latest period as `currPeriod` and the other/previous period as `prevPeriod`.\n- If it has one value, use the same value for both `currPeriod` and `prevPeriod`.\n- Ignore everything else.\n- Return only the object. No explanation."
                    }
